{"about_the_game":"Detective work is never easy. When the body of Alexander Wolff is found floating down in the pool at a party for the film about his life, there's only one man (well, Fox) for the job. You were cleared for that whole thing with the gingerbread man, anyway.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/cf4df08298267a2b55b55c2a91a5d7a8.avif?t=1768503138\" width=520 height=94 /></span><br><br>You\u2019re going to need an edge and that cool tie isn\u2019t enough.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.poster.avif?t=1768503138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.webm?t=1768503138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.mp4?t=1768503138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Thank God they partnered you with Maxwell. His manners are questionable, but he can see all of space and time so it\u2019s easy to forgive the little things.<br><br>With the right information and some light encouragement, Max will take you back to the exact moment you\u2019re looking for.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/5333bdb1576aca1b53eba7e1e6371191.avif?t=1768503138\" width=520 height=94 /></span><br><br>You can\u2019t just walk into a mob boss\u2019 house. But the murder got you some breathing room and the Chief has made a deal. You've got one night to investigate the house.<br><br>It\u2019s a gorgeous mansion. Eighteen rooms. A three-storey fish tank. A garage larger than your entire apartment and a pool overlooking the coast. <br><br>And they say crime doesn\u2019t pay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/4bc3de6a9624fee0c5d49afee7b97865.avif?t=1768503138\" width=520 height=94 /></span><br><br>9 suspects, one evening. What did they do? What secrets are they hiding?<br><br>They\u2019re not just gonna tell you, that\u2019s for sure.<br><br>Interrogate, cross reference, or just wildly accuse them with no proof. You\u2019re the detective, after all.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1786320?t=1768503138","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1786320?t=1768503138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768503138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768503138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Detective work is never easy. When the body of Alexander Wolff is found floating down in the pool at a party for the film about his life, there's only one man (well, Fox) for the job. You were cleared for that whole thing with the gingerbread man, anyway.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/cf4df08298267a2b55b55c2a91a5d7a8.avif?t=1768503138\" width=520 height=94 /></span><br><br>You\u2019re going to need an edge and that cool tie isn\u2019t enough.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.poster.avif?t=1768503138\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.webm?t=1768503138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/c789ae694224ec9aebd3eba47524e7a4.mp4?t=1768503138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Thank God they partnered you with Maxwell. His manners are questionable, but he can see all of space and time so it\u2019s easy to forgive the little things.<br><br>With the right information and some light encouragement, Max will take you back to the exact moment you\u2019re looking for.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/5333bdb1576aca1b53eba7e1e6371191.avif?t=1768503138\" width=520 height=94 /></span><br><br>You can\u2019t just walk into a mob boss\u2019 house. But the murder got you some breathing room and the Chief has made a deal. You've got one night to investigate the house.<br><br>It\u2019s a gorgeous mansion. Eighteen rooms. A three-storey fish tank. A garage larger than your entire apartment and a pool overlooking the coast. <br><br>And they say crime doesn\u2019t pay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1786320/extras/4bc3de6a9624fee0c5d49afee7b97865.avif?t=1768503138\" width=520 height=94 /></span><br><br>9 suspects, one evening. What did they do? What secrets are they hiding?<br><br>They\u2019re not just gonna tell you, that\u2019s for sure.<br><br>Interrogate, cross reference, or just wildly accuse them with no proof. You\u2019re the detective, after all.","developers":["Fat Toad Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it